[{"type":"message","user":"U0218A9LKTJ","text":"\u003c@U0218A9LKTJ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1619779609.434300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"dbf5633c-a4a4-4dd7-8146-32df2e731efc","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"EV系株には乗り遅れた感があるから次は何が良いかなーと探してます","ts":"1619752668.433500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sOf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f35a7031-2dc7-42fc-9e05-6cde69425c37","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まー、規模が発展して制御しにくくなるみたいな部分あるだろうし、行動の指針と(小いうちの)実績を見てるんでしょうね\nだた目にあまると落されそうだけど、事例あるかな?","ts":"1619750034.431600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L+ojO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46F5A74A-48E2-4A92-A6AC-EF7287893075","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"とはいえ上場したら、知らんがなでぜんぜん問題ないんですけどね。","ts":"1619749931.430400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZLRU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92ab4666-3175-4bc5-bbdc-e1d1d5a346cc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"極端にいえば、会社たたむところまで制御できてる会社なら、株式市場にいても混乱の元にはならないけど\n黒字だろうが制御できてないところは市場が(空売りなどもあるので)悪化する元でしかない、みたいな","ts":"1619749616.429400","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1619749657.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/6w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6e459cf-c9c3-4da1-84ef-caa7343e57e1","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"事業単位でも予算との乖離にすごく厳しいのはそういうことだったのと得心","ts":"1619749555.428500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/aztt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93FEB358-4788-4947-A4CC-4D05CB28A94E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"上場審査って黒字化してるかどうかではなく、予算との一致率を凄い厳しく見られるんですよね。めっちゃ黒字出してても予算と乖離しまくってたらなかなか上場できない。","ts":"1619749422.427000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ig2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7d6bc73-7393-4214-acd2-c0bdd98fd41a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"任天堂はずーっとエンタメ一筋で、その中でどうやって安定させるかで一つの手段として、大量のキャッシュを持ってるわけで…ほかのエンタメ企業とは性格が違うんですよね。","ts":"1619749046.425300","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1619749055.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0QW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"522f89ab-173f-455b-be18-aa63f96a3dda","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"今後、どうなるかは注目したい。","ts":"1619748970.424300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hx/k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"225faba4-ffda-45a3-aba1-5566abfd36d5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"その観点でいうとサイバーエージェントは出自はエンタメ企業ではないですからね。","ts":"1619748944.423800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1619748955.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sFVPQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d84d3cb0-34fe-48a4-abe9-0c569e7cb781","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"事業計画とのすり合わせ大事","ts":"1619748888.422900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6ZIDm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50f92eee-0116-4e53-983f-46b7b6d1e10b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ、それは本当にそうですね","ts":"1619748866.422500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uoqg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d04b2c73-4a9c-4820-8de2-6957e0ec626d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですねえ、突発があるにせよ、それを予想制御できているなら、甘くはなりにくいんだろうな\nでも突発は予想できない(しても規模が決めにくい)から突発なんだろうし、むずかしい","ts":"1619748824.421800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"saWc6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93e3f5c0-4952-4381-be58-db426d6dbaa7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"計画外の流行り廃り浮き沈みってのは、水商売の特徴ではある。","ts":"1619748780.420800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yjO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4659b678-0b64-44a1-9a3d-977e539bef8f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"安定ってのは黒字を続けることじゃなくて、予算・収益計画が達成されるかどうかだと思いますよ。計画外のヒットに慣れると、そこが甘くなる。","ts":"1619748723.420300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL"]},{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IYthX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a866d64a-7837-42dc-a892-d1a26d08a5a2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"不安定を抑えこむ(安定)か不安定を飲み込む(長期で黒字続き)か...","ts":"1619748480.418700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Zn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c124f8a-d088-47c0-a9de-385034683b3f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"不安定でも長期的に見ると黒字でずっとトップ走れるってのは近視眼的なやり方だと絶対できないから偉いな〜と","ts":"1619748237.418200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BHilk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43185dc5-957e-436e-9d41-42caf0729923","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"任天堂も集英社も波はかなりあるからなあ…\n波があっても当てるときでっかく当てればいいスタイル（個人的には安定よりこっちのが好き）","ts":"1619748168.417600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lG+X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20092c25-ecd8-48ce-a6e2-7cbdaff06c87","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"純粋に企業としては…波があるのはよろしくないよね。","ts":"1619747898.416800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eNGMC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"517a63c2-5601-45c3-871d-dd13ec19ab1a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"コンテンツ業界ではまれによくあるやつかな","ts":"1619747874.416300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2jF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7999cdd-9e2e-4a41-b842-1f2ab99a591d","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"決算の資料作成時点と報告時でDL数が+100万乗ってる","ts":"1619747601.415500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WFQ1o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90e1b188-68b3-4870-ba84-7e68fc5a00e1","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"下手打たなければ多分その予想も超えてくる","ts":"1619747543.414600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GjwE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3c91875-6493-4e61-a50f-f6c7b469caf6","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"今までの収益が数十億円って数字から次の予想が200億超えだもんな","ts":"1619747516.414100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zdhZZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d0d95e7-882a-4b40-8c20-d303162dc41b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"だったかもですねw","ts":"1619747487.413500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8oYwf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b885b75-a5b8-47a9-b7c8-88fb31e073e0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"うまぴょいが出た時点で買っておけばなぁ","ts":"1619747457.412700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ujNG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67b84d72-e1e4-4464-8fa8-af4624c773ec","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"決算報告ageみたいですね","ts":"1619747442.412400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rQh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5e590f0-8c49-4923-8a95-fa46d060461b"